{"id":"5056e5ab9eec996f","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-weyl.md","title":"Weyl","display":"df-weyl — Weyl","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weyl","aliases":["58-df-weyl"],"display":"df-weyl — Weyl","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-weyl-sum.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-sum.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weyl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weyl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weyl — Weyl"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91532bc163cf2518\" href=\"?note=91532bc163cf2518\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-weyl-sum.md\">../batch03/58-df-weyl-sum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8235a298a67c2370\" href=\"?note=8235a298a67c2370\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-sum.md\">../batch17/58-df-sum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:\\omega\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(x:\\omega\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> (real sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the set-function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{t\\}=t-\\lfloor t\\rfloor\">\\(\\{t\\}=t-\\lfloor t\\rfloor\\)</span> (fractional part)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeylEquidistributed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WeylEquidistributed}_S\\)</span> (equidistribution modulo one predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl} \\vdash \\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\{t\\}\\coloneqq t-\\lfloor t\\rfloor\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl} \\vdash \\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\{t\\}\\coloneqq t-\\lfloor t\\rfloor\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeylEquidistributed}_S(x) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0\\leq a&lt;b\\leq1\\to\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\frac{|\\{n\\in\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}:\\{x(n)\\}\\in[a,b)\\}|}{N}=b-a\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeylEquidistributed}_S(x) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0\\leq a&lt;b\\leq1\\to\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\frac{|\\{n\\in\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}:\\{x(n)\\}\\in[a,b)\\}|}{N}=b-a\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom defines equidistribution modulo one by interval frequencies and now types its argument as an actual real sequence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-weyl-sum.md","status":"resolved","id":"91532bc163cf2518","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-weyl-sum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-sum.md","status":"resolved","id":"8235a298a67c2370","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-sum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ is the set-function predicate (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x:\\omega\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{t\\}=t-\\lfloor t\\rfloor","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeylEquidistributed}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl} \\vdash \\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\{t\\}\\coloneqq t-\\lfloor t\\rfloor\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weyl} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeylEquidistributed}_S(x) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0\\leq a<b\\leq1\\to\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\frac{|\\{n\\in\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}:\\{x(n)\\}\\in[a,b)\\}|}{N}=b-a\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1077,"backlinks":[{"id":"b704bd521f4cdc1f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1392","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-weyl.md|58-df-weyl]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["91532bc163cf2518","8235a298a67c2370","36d7463d215be751"]}